== Plugins ==
All of the following plugins are available on both officially approved third-party [[Game client|Game clients]]. On RuneLite they must be installed separately from the Plugin Hub, accessed from the Configuration button (wrench icon on sidebar), then clicking the Plugin Hub button (right-most plug icon). On HDOS these plugins come preinstalled.

=== Custom Menu Swaps ===

* To have the Spinderling attack options appear on top of Spindel: Add <code>Attack,Spindel's Spiderling*</code> to "Custom Swaps"

